  m_Name: ArcadeGameThornbush
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  Mode: 103
  IsMultiplayer: 1
  DisplayName: Thornbush
  Description: 'Shrikes only - build in the thorn bush. Dock on a stick and press Mass to leave a nest
    - a cup of super-shielded blocks crowned with a missile plant. You keep three; a fourth
    retires the oldest. The score is the mass standing in your colour when the clock runs
    out, nests and trail. Paint a rival to send your missiles at their nests and break what
    is under the shields. Higher intensities grow the heap and tip its sticks with danger.
    Most mass standing at the whistle wins.'
